The Rust code of this crate is ported from OpenBSD's bwfm(4) driver
(sys/dev/ic/bwfm.c rev 1.118, bwfmreg.h rev 1.28, bwfmvar.h rev 1.32,
sys/dev/sdmmc/if_bwfm_sdio.c rev 1.45, if_bwfm_sdio.h rev 1.3). It keeps
the notices of those files, reproduced below.

